    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Good grief... And I have a word for Mister Hellagur as well!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I explicitly told him to keep an eye on you, so why did he turn a blind eye..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Until a contract is signed, Rhodes Island is not allowed to intervene in the internal affairs of an independent city-state."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "If we get caught up in legal repercussions, Rhodes Island will be in a very tight spot."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Actually, I already...",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Yes, I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Doctor, you really did something very dangerous."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...Why were you fighting with crazed fans anyway! If you're an adult, you should act like one."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "No matter how much you like a band, you need to be nice to the other audience members, and you certainly can't pick fights with them!"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "...? But we were...",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "(Shush!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "No more questions! That wraps up this incident! Okay!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Be more careful next time, okay?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
